eading":"《文士傳》記殷禮子殷基及其著《通語》。基三子，本文僅具二名。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line032-pei01-01:reading-000-247","kind":"annotation_sentence","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line032-pei01-01","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":247,"source_quote":"殷基《通語》曰：初權旣立和爲太子，而封霸爲魯王，初拜猶同宮室，禮秩未分。羣公之議，以爲太子、國王上下有序，禮秩宜異，於是分宮別僚，而隙端開矣。自侍御賔客造爲二端，仇黨疑貳，滋延大臣。丞相陸遜、大將軍諸葛恪、太常顧譚、驃騎將軍朱據、會稽太守滕胤、大都督施績、尚書丁密等奉禮而行，宗事太子，驃騎將軍步隲、鎮南將軍呂岱、大司馬全琮、左將軍呂據、中書令孫弘等附魯王，中外官僚將軍大臣舉國中分。權患之，謂侍中孫峻曰：「子弟不睦，臣下分部，將有袁氏之敗，爲天下笑。一人立者，安得不亂？」於是有改嗣之規矣。　","person_id":"i5r_vby_q00_A","related_person_ids":["572_278_cba","572_278_cba_A","572_278_cba_B","lii_454_vuv","512_1cd_a4b","syc_ik6_bq5_**AAA","ejj_vdz_hxw","wgt_wdg_vkv","cfb_d3e_1b8","uxk_94s_ndu","snv_2iq_jes","2oe_qam_pq4","984_9e1_5e9","0fp_euq_upj","gb5_61l_46e","ec3_vc7_z1i"],"reading":"殷基通語列太子與魯王兩黨；丁密另見卷57丁固避名。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-he"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-wu052-gs-yinji","subject_person_id":"i5r_vby_q00_A","object_person_id":"i5r_vby_q00","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"礼子基"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-01","quote":"礼子基作通语曰：礼字德嗣，弱不好弄，潜识过人。少为郡吏，年十九，守吴县丞。孙权为王，召除郎中。后与张温俱使蜀，诸葛亮甚称叹之。稍迁至零陵太守，卒官。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-01:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-01:m0000"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-wu052-gs-yinju","subject_person_id":"i5r_vby_q00_AA","object_person_id":"i5r_vby_q00_A","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"有三子。巨字元大"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","boo